// The Feud — Villager after the Menaphite Leader is gone (§19.7). New file.
// CANDIDATE 2007-base (OSRS Transcript:The Feud §19.7 Talking to a Villager,
// minus the 27 Apr 2022 lore pass — §19.7 carries no BCS lines). World NPC
// multi bases feud_villager_multi_1/2/3 (1887/1891/1895, e.g. 3355,2949
// m52_46); vis faces feud_villager_1_1.._3_3 (1888-1890 / 1892-1894 /
// 1896-1898) "Villager" op1=Talk-to while %feud_npc_multi 0/1/2 — bind the
// nine vis names, NOT the multi bases. Stand 3354,2949 W of the multi_1 pin
// 3355,2949. Not on the NPC.
// Gate: %feud_var_menaboss >= 1 (Tough Guy killed, §18.5 PASS feudtsy35b22 —
// Leader gone, menaboss flag) else return. §19.7 verbatim, chat only:
// Hello. -> "You! You're the one that just made everything worse for us poor
// villagers!" -> "What?! I just single-handedly took apart one of the gangs
// that was ruining your town!" -> "You adventurers! You never think, you
// just act." -> "You've created a vacuum" -> "Our elderly mayor, or the
// leader of the bandits?" -> "Oops. Sorry, I was just trying to help." ->
// "the two gangs pretty much cancelled each other out" -> "the Bandits reign
// unopposed!" -> "this adventuring lark is a lot more complicated" -> "fix
// this mess you created!" then ~p_choice2 — exactly two options, no extra
// Yes: "What do you mean by fix the mess I created?" -> "Do I have to spell
// it out to you?" / "Would you please?" / "Just run the bandits out of
// town. Incidentally, I spotted their leader to the north-west just a few
// minutes ago." · "Ok I'll get to it." -> spoken "Okay, I'll get to it."
// §21.4 Finishing up (Bandit champion dead, §20.4 PASS d478d3333):
// %feud_var_banditboss >= 1 dispatches @feud_villager_after BEFORE the
// celebrate — "Now are you satisfied?" -> "Oh, it's you again!" -> "I have
// delivered you from two evil tyrants. Where's my thank you?" -> "Thank you?
// For what? You come into our town. You rob, mug, burgle and kill and then
// expect respect and gratitude? Look, if it's praise and thanks you're
// looking for, talk to the mayor." -> "I wonder why I bother sometimes! This
// place has been nothing but trouble and I still haven't found Ali's
// nephew." Chat only, then return. Mayor nephew reveal is later (§21.5).
// Chat only — no var writes. Do NOT write %feud_talk_villager (343 is the
// pick-count leftover) and do NOT write %feud_bandit_boss_vis (338) this hop
// (Bandit Leader §20 later). No stage write / no 28 / no dest / p_tele.
// No && / ||.
// Cite copy-agent-opener-377.md · feud-varbit-map-377.md §5 §7 · Transcript:The Feud.

[opnpc1,feud_villager_1_1]
if (%feud_var_banditboss >= 1) {
    @feud_villager_after;
}
if (%feud_var_menaboss < 1) { return; }
@feud_villager_celebrate;

[opnpc1,feud_villager_1_2]
if (%feud_var_banditboss >= 1) {
    @feud_villager_after;
}
if (%feud_var_menaboss < 1) { return; }
@feud_villager_celebrate;

